---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Mahindra Lifespaces Legacy & Pune Portfolio | Homes of Positive Energy"
  description="Discover the 75+ year legacy of the Mahindra Group, Mahindra Lifespaces' 50+ residential projects, green building pioneer status, and proven track record across Pune."
  canonical="https://www.mahindralifespaceshomes.in/brand"
>
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="pt-32 pb-20 bg-charcoal-950 border-b border-white/10 relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-6 text-center">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center space-x-2 px-3 py-1 rounded bg-brand-red/10 border border-brand-red/30 text-brand-red text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-brand-red"></span>
        <span>A Legacy Built on Trust</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold text-stone-100 max-w-4xl mx-auto leading-tight">
        The Mahindra Legacy: <br />
        <span class="gold-gradient-text">Pioneering Sustainable Living</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-stone-300 text-sm sm:text-base max-w-2xl mx-auto font-light leading-relaxed">
        Part of the US $20+ Billion Mahindra Group, Mahindra Lifespaces Developers Limited is India’s foremost pioneer in green buildings and integrated master-planned communities.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Key Statistics Strip -->
  <section class="py-12 bg-charcoal-900 border-b border-white/10">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8 text-center">
        <div>
          <div class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-gold-400">75+ Years</div>
          <div class="text-xs text-stone-400 uppercase tracking-widest mt-1">Mahindra Group Heritage</div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-stone-100">50+</div>
          <div class="text-xs text-stone-400 uppercase tracking-widest mt-1">Residential Projects Pan-India</div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-gold-400">55.5M+</div>
          <div class="text-xs text-stone-400 uppercase tracking-widest mt-1">Sq. Ft. Completed & Upcoming</div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-stone-100">21,000+</div>
          <div class="text-xs text-stone-400 uppercase tracking-widest mt-1">Delighted Resident Families</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="text-[10px] text-center text-stone-500 mt-4">
        *Source: Mahindra Lifespaces Corporate Disclosures & Annual Reports.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Sustainability: Homes of Positive Energy -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-charcoal-950">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-16">
      
      <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto space-y-3">
        <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-gold-400 font-bold">The Green Manifesto</span>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-stone-100 font-bold">Homes of Positive Energy</h2>
        <p class="text-xs text-stone-400 leading-relaxed">
          Every Mahindra residence is envisioned as an ecological sanctum that harmonizes natural light, fresh air circulation, and resource replenishment.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        
        <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-charcoal-900 border border-white/10 space-y-4">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400 flex items-center justify-center border border-emerald-500/20 text-xl font-serif">
            ☀
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-serif text-xl text-stone-100 font-semibold">Energy Decarbonization</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-stone-400 leading-relaxed">
            Passive solar architectural layouts, rooftop solar generation offsetting common area lighting, EV rapid-charging bays, and energy-efficient LED and VRF air-conditioning infrastructure.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-charcoal-900 border border-white/10 space-y-4">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-cyan-500/10 text-cyan-400 flex items-center justify-center border border-cyan-500/20 text-xl font-serif">
            💧
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-serif text-xl text-stone-100 font-semibold">Net-Zero Water Vision</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-stone-400 leading-relaxed">
            100% wastewater treatment via state-of-the-art on-site STPs, high-efficiency low-flow aerator plumbing fixtures, and extensive rainwater harvesting recharge pits throughout the 13.46-acre site.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-charcoal-900 border border-white/10 space-y-4">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-gold-500/10 text-gold-400 flex items-center justify-center border border-gold-500/20 text-xl font-serif">
            🌱
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-serif text-xl text-stone-100 font-semibold">Biodiversity & Waste Cycle</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-stone-400 leading-relaxed">
            Zero-garbage landfill goal with organic waste converters generating natural compost for indigenous Miyawaki micro-forests, preserving local fauna and butterfly corridors.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Pune Portfolio Showcase -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-charcoal-900 border-t border-white/10">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-12">
      <div class="text-center space-y-3">
        <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-gold-400 font-bold">Pune Track Record</span>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-stone-100 font-bold">Completed & Ongoing Developments</h2>
        <p class="text-xs text-stone-400 max-w-xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
          Explore Mahindra’s proven legacy in creating vibrant residential ecosystems across Pune.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        
        <div class="glass-card rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-white/10 space-y-4">
          <img
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1545324418-cc1a3fa10c00?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80"
            alt="Mahindra Antheia Pimpri"
            class="w-full h-48 object-cover"
          />
          <div class="p-6 pt-0 space-y-2">
            <span class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-400 font-bold">Delivered Landmark</span>
            <h3 class="font-serif text-lg text-stone-100 font-semibold">Mahindra Antheia</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-stone-400">Pimpri-Chinchwad, Pune • 16-acre master community with extensive sports and clubhouse amenities.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="glass-card rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-white/10 space-y-4">
          <img
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600585154340-be6161a56a0c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80"
            alt="Mahindra Centralis Pimpri"
            class="w-full h-48 object-cover"
          />
          <div class="p-6 pt-0 space-y-2">
            <span class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-400 font-bold">Delivered Landmark</span>
            <h3 class="font-serif text-lg text-stone-100 font-semibold">Mahindra Centralis</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-stone-400">Pimpri, Pune • Four high-rise residential towers designed around urban lifestyle conveniences.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="glass-card rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-white/10 space-y-4">
          <img
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1512917774080-9991f1c4c750?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80"
            alt="Mahindra Happinest Tathawade"
            class="w-full h-48 object-cover"
          />
          <div class="p-6 pt-0 space-y-2">
            <span class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-gold-400 font-bold">Under Construction</span>
            <h3 class="font-serif text-lg text-stone-100 font-semibold">Mahindra Happinest Tathawade</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-stone-400">Tathawade, West Pune • India’s first fusion home development blending indoor and outdoor living.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
